FFmpeg
======

The Linux host can decode video through an FFmpeg build that this repository makes for itself
(`host/ffmpeg/build.sh`): FFmpeg 8.0.1, LGPL version 2.1 or later, built as shared libraries with
no GPL or nonfree parts, no programs and no network support.

Only the decoders and demuxers for the royalty-free formats are built in: the MP4, WebM, Ogg, WAV,
FLAC and MP3 containers, and VP8, VP9, AV1, Opus, Vorbis, FLAC, MP3 and PCM codecs. H.264 and AAC
are not part of it.

